cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Square Root or build on the idea, please cite it as below."
title: "Square Root"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nosrati
    given-names: Neo
    email: neo@all1web.com
    website: "https://neonos.net"
repository-code: "https://github.com/all1web/square-root"
url: "https://github.com/all1web/square-root"
abstract: >-
  A mobile-first CSS + JS layout framework that scales one canonical design
  (360 x 720, built on a researched 60px finger unit) to fit any phone
  exactly - same proportions on every screen size and aspect ratio, without
  breakpoints. The runtime solves the root font-size so the rem-authored
  canon lands exactly on the real viewport. Invented by Neo Nosrati.
license: MIT
version: 0.4.0
date-released: "2026-09-09"
keywords:
  - css
  - scss
  - layout
  - mobile-first
  - responsive
  - viewport-scaling
  - touch-targets
